{"sections":[{"slug":"∞-向量丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"∞-向量丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“∞-<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“∞-向量丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为交换环</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/E∞-环","text":"E∞-<span lang=\"zh\">环</span>"}},{"Plain":"), $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $K$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">将空间等同于</span> (∞-) <span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模丛就是函子</span> $X \\to A\\mathrm {Mod}$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}